WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:04,260
little girlfriend

2
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:13,620
Who are you talking about? Isn't it Jian Tong? Shen Jianxiu

3
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,980
Don't say she's not her. If she wasn't your little girlfriend, why would you care about her life or death?

4
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,460
It's none of your business that she has a fever

5
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,780
Don't say you pity her

6
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,700
You, President Shen Da

7
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,300
Since when have you been so compassionate?

8
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,660
Not your little girlfriend

9
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:26,820
You drove her to the hospital yourself in the middle of the night

10
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:32,860
Can you pull him down? Mr. Shen will be fine.

11
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,860
I'll go out first and leave her here with you.

12
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:38,640
Keep an eye on me, she's awake

13
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,760
Just tell her

14
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,080
she fainted

15
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,800
You found an acquaintance to drop water on her

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,780
you let go

17
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:48,400
Miss Shen, I warn you if you don’t let me go.

18
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:49,560
I don't want to say goodbye to you

19
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,290
You want to leave me alone

20
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:57,900
avoid talking avoid talking
